invalid type: string "In Java, a **class** is a blueprint from which individual objects are created.\n\n```java\npublic class Cadet {\n    private String name;\n    private int score;\n\n    public Cadet(String name, int score) {\n        this.name = name;\n        this.score = score;\n    }\n\n    public void display() {\n        System.out.println(name + \": \" + score);\n    }\n}\n```"ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ